==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Kang Roo
|Shadow Boxer K
|Kang Roo's [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant, with much higher stats, Area Attack, more knockbacks and a faster attack rate.
|Scissoroo
|Kang Roo's [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant, with Area Attack, longer range, no multi-hit and a chance to knockback cats.
|Zang Roo
|Kang Roo's [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant, with much higher stats and Area Attack. Burrows under cats and revives once with 100% HP.
|Ms. Madonna
|First seen in the [[Spring for Sensei (Monthly Event)|Spring for Sensei]] event. Attacks less often, but has a 100% chance to knockback cats and create a Lv.3 [[Wave Attack]].
|Doctor K.O.
|Kang Roo's [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant. Has similar stats to a 300% Shadow Boxer K, but with a higher money drop, health, range and speed and only 3 knockbacks.
}}

